PART 2: UNDERSTANDING FORM SUBMISSION AND VALIDATION
================================================================================

WHAT IS FORM SUBMISSION?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Form submission begins when a user:

• Clicks a submit button

• Presses Enter in an appropriate form control

• Triggers form submission programmatically


In React:

<form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>


The submit handler receives an event:

const handleSubmit = (
  event
) => {

  event.preventDefault()

  // Validation and processing
}


================================================================================
WHAT IS FORM VALIDATION?
================================================================================

Form validation checks whether submitted values meet the application's
requirements.

Common validation categories:

• Required value

• Minimum/maximum length

• Format

• Numeric range

• Matching fields

• Allowed values

• Business rules

• Server-dependent rules


================================================================================
VALIDATION TYPES
================================================================================

+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| VALIDATION TYPE      | EXAMPLE                                       |
+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| Required             | First name must not be empty                  |
| Minimum Length       | Name must contain at least 2 characters       |
| Maximum Length       | Name must not exceed 50 characters            |
| Email Format         | Email should have an acceptable structure     |
| Phone Rule           | Phone should contain enough digits            |
| Number Range         | Age must be between allowed limits            |
| Matching Fields      | Password and confirmation must match          |
| Custom Rule          | Username must follow product rules            |
| Async Rule           | Username must be checked with server          |
+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+


