================================================================================
PART 6: FORM SUBMISSION WORKFLOW
================================================================================

COMPLETE WORKFLOW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. User enters data

        ↓

2. Controlled form state updates

        ↓

3. User submits form

        ↓

4. onSubmit executes

        ↓

5. preventDefault() prevents native submission

        ↓

6. validatePersonForm(formData) executes

        ↓

7. Does validation return errors?

        ├── YES
        │     ↓
        │   setErrors(...)
        │     ↓
        │   Messages displayed
        │     ↓
        │   User corrects fields
        │
        └── NO
              ↓
            Normalize values
              ↓
            Create person object
              ↓
            Add person to people array
              ↓
            Clear form/errors
              ↓
            Show success feedback
              ↓
            Render new person card


================================================================================
SUBMISSION WORKFLOW TABLE
================================================================================

+------+-----------------------------+----------------------------------+
| STEP | ACTION                      | RESULT                           |
+------+-----------------------------+----------------------------------+
| 1    | User enters data            | formData updates                 |
| 2    | User submits                | onSubmit event fires             |
| 3    | preventDefault()            | Native submit prevented          |
| 4    | Validate                    | errors object created            |
| 5A   | Invalid                     | Error messages displayed         |
| 5B   | Valid                       | Person record created            |
| 6    | Update array                | Person added immutably           |
| 7    | Reset form                  | Fields become empty              |
| 8    | Clear errors                | Validation messages removed      |
| 9    | Render                      | Person card appears              |
| 10   | Delete if requested         | Matching card removed            |
+------+-----------------------------+----------------------------------+


================================================================================
STATE RESPONSIBILITIES
================================================================================

formData:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Current editable field values


errors:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Current field-specific validation messages


people:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Successfully submitted person records


submissionMessage:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Submission feedback shown to the user


================================================================================
FORM STATE VS STORED PERSON
================================================================================

formData:

{
  firstName:
    ' John ',

  age:
    '35'
}


Stored person:

{
  id:
    '...',

  firstName:
    'John',

  age:
    35
}


This is useful because:

• Editing values may be strings

• Submitted values may be normalized

• Record data may use more suitable domain types


